
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Welcome to DIU Smart Hall System</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f1f5f9; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e293b;">

  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="padding:35px 12px;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">

        <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
          style="max-width:600px; width:100%; background:#ffffff; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden;">

          <!-- Header -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="background:#12366b; padding:28px 20px;">
              <h1 style="margin:0; color:#ffffff; font-size:25px;">
                DIU Smart Hall System
              </h1>
              <p style="margin:8px 0 0; color:#bfdbfe; font-size:13px;">
                Daffodil International University
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Welcome Banner -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="background:#eff6ff; padding:35px 25px 25px;">
              <div style="font-size:48px; line-height:1.2;">🎉</div>
              <h1 style="font-size:30px; color:#12366b; margin:15px 0 10px;">
                Welcome Aboard!
              </h1>
              <p style="font-size:15px; color:#64748b; margin:0; line-height:1.7;">
                Your smarter and more comfortable hall life starts here.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Main Content -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:30px 35px 15px;">
              <h2 style="font-size:20px; color:#12366b; margin:0 0 15px;">
                Hi <%= name %>!
              </h2>

              <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.8; color:#475569; margin:0 0 15px;">
                We're excited to welcome you to the
                <strong>DIU Smart Hall System!</strong>
                Your account has been successfully created.
              </p>

              <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.8; color:#475569; margin:0;">
                You can now explore our platform and enjoy a
                smarter, safer, and more convenient hall experience.
                Everything you need is just a few clicks away.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Features -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:20px 25px;">
              <h2 style="text-align:center; font-size:20px; color:#12366b; margin:0 0 20px;">
                What You Can Do
              </h2>

              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="10" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td width="50%" valign="top"
                    style="background:#eff6ff; border-radius:10px; padding:18px; text-align:center;">
                    <div style="font-size:30px;">🏠</div>
                    <h3 style="font-size:15px; color:#12366b; margin:10px 0;">
                      Hall Management
                    </h3>
                    <p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#64748b; margin:0;">
                      View your hall, room details, and important notices.
                    </p>
                  </td>

                  <td width="50%" valign="top"
                    style="background:#f0fdf4; border-radius:10px; padding:18px; text-align:center;">
                    <div style="font-size:30px;">👥</div>
                    <h3 style="font-size:15px; color:#166534; margin:10px 0;">
                      Stay Connected
                    </h3>
                    <p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#64748b; margin:0;">
                      Connect with hall authorities and stay updated.
                    </p>
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                  <td width="50%" valign="top"
                    style="background:#faf5ff; border-radius:10px; padding:18px; text-align:center;">
                    <div style="font-size:30px;">🛡️</div>
                    <h3 style="font-size:15px; color:#6b21a8; margin:10px 0;">
                      Safety & Security
                    </h3>
                    <p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#64748b; margin:0;">
                      Access available hall security services.
                    </p>
                  </td>

                  <td width="50%" valign="top"
                    style="background:#fff7ed; border-radius:10px; padding:18px; text-align:center;">
                    <div style="font-size:30px;">⚙️</div>
                    <h3 style="font-size:15px; color:#c2410c; margin:10px 0;">
                      More Services
                    </h3>
                    <p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#64748b; margin:0;">
                      Explore maintenance, canteen, and other services.
                    </p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Support -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:10px 35px 25px;">
              <div style="background:#eff6ff; border-left:4px solid #2563eb; border-radius:8px; padding:18px;">
                <h3 style="font-size:16px; color:#12366b; margin:0 0 8px;">
                  💙 We're Here to Help!
                </h3>
                <p style="font-size:13px; color:#475569; line-height:1.7; margin:0;">
                  If you have any questions or face any issues,
                  please contact your hall authority or support team.
                  We're happy to help!
                </p>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- CTA -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:5px 25px 30px;">
              <a href="https://your-frontend-url.com"
                style="display:inline-block; background:#2563eb; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; padding:15px 35px; border-radius:8px;">
                Go to Your Dashboard &rarr;
              </a>

              <p style="font-size:13px; color:#94a3b8; margin:20px 0 0;">
                Thank you for being a part of DIU!
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="background:#12366b; padding:25px 20px;">
              <h3 style="color:#ffffff; font-size:16px; margin:0 0 8px;">
                DIU Smart Hall System
              </h3>
              <p style="color:#bfdbfe; font-size:12px; margin:0 0 12px;">
                Daffodil International University
              </p>
              <div style="height:1px; background:#355785; margin:15px 0;"></div>
              <p style="color:#cbd5e1; font-size:11px; line-height:1.6; margin:0;">
                Better Living, Smarter Campus<br />
                &copy; 2026 DIU Smart Hall System. All rights reserved.
              </p>
              <p style="color:#94a3b8; font-size:10px; margin:12px 0 0;">
                This is an automated email. Please do not reply.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>